{
 "issue_summary": "Aapne Mobile World se Rs 18,999 ka phone kharida jisme 2 mahine mein green line display issue aa gaya. Service center ise liquid damage bata kar warranty dene se mana kar raha hai, jabki aapka kehna hai ki phone geela nahi hua.",
 "claims": [
  {
   "text": "Aap Consumer Protection Act, 2019 ke tehat 'consumer' ki shreni mein aate hain agar yeh phone aapne personal use ke liye kharida hai.",
   "type": "verified_law",
   "provision_id": "CPA2019-S2-7",
   "support_quote": "\"consumer\" means any person who-- (i) buys any goods for a consideration which has been paid or promised or partly paid and partly promised"
  },
  {
   "text": "Product mein koi fault ya kami hone par use 'defect' mana jata hai.",
   "type": "verified_law",
   "provision_id": "CPA2019-S2-10",
   "support_quote": "\"defect\" means any fault, imperfection or shortcoming in the quality, quantity, potency, purity or standard which is required to be maintained"
  },
  {
   "text": "Consumer Commission complaint ki date se do saal ke andar case file karne ki anumati deta hai.",
   "type": "verified_law",
   "provision_id": "CPA2019-S69",
   "support_quote": "The District Commission, the State Commission or the National Commission shall not admit a complaint unless it is filed within two years from the date on which the cause of action has arisen."
  }
 ],
 "options": [
  {
   "title": "Formal Legal Notice bhejein",
   "description": "Seller aur service center ko ek likhit legal notice bhejein jisme bill copy attach karein aur repair, replacement ya refund ki demand karein."
  },
  {
   "title": "National Consumer Helpline par complaint karein",
   "description": "Aap NCH portal ya helpline number par toll-free call karke grievance register kara sakte hain."
  },
  {
   "title": "District Consumer Commission mein case file karein",
   "description": "Agar seller/service center respond na kare, toh aap e-daakhil portal ke zariye online ya District Commission mein offline complaint file kar sakte hain."
  }
 ],
 "next_steps": [
  "Purchase invoice/bill aur service center ki denial job sheet secure karke rakhein.",
  "Phone ki current condition aur green line display ke photos aur video record kar lein.",
  "Shopkeeper aur service center ko ek written email ya legal notice bhejkar 15 din ka time dein."
 ],
 "uncertainties": [
  "Aapne phone personal use ke liye liya tha ya business use ke liye?",
  "Kya aapke paas service center ki written inspection report ya job sheet hai jisme unhone 'liquid damage' likha hai?"
 ],
 "lawyer_recommended": false,
 "lawyer_reason": "",
 "reply": "Aapke phone mein display issue aana aur service center dwara bina strong proof ke warranty refuse karna ek consumer dispute hai. CPA 2019 ke tehat defected product par aap free repair, replacement ya refund claim kar sakte hain. Aapka case 2 saal ki limitation period ke andar hai.\n\nAapke paas yeh vikalp hain:\n1. Mobile World aur Service Center ko ek written notice ya email bhejein aur ek reasonable deadline dein.\n2. National Consumer Helpline (NCH) par grievance register karein.\n3. Agar samadhan na mile toh District Consumer Commission (e-Daakhil portal) par complaint file karein. (Kripya filing se pehle District Commission ki monetary limit verify kar lein).\n\nAgle kadam:\n- Job sheet aur purchase bill sambhal kar rakhein.\n- Screen defect ke clear photos/videos le lein.\n- Written notice bhejein.\n\nYeh sirf kanooni jankari hai, koi legal advice nahi."
